  "_doc": "Phase 09 fighter registry. Each entry = { render, data }. render is loader-only (preload + anim registry + sprite frame counts, decoupled from sim frames). data is compact authorable sim config; src/sim/character-builder.ts assembleCharacter() reconstructs the full CharacterConfig, src/sim/validate-character.ts validates it (shared by BootScene + the dev Vite write-back). Boxes are fighter-local: +x forward, +y up from feet. High/low blocking is box geometry, not labels. overrides[state]=[{frame,hurt?,push?,hit?}] are per-frame tweaks the Character Gym (?scene=gym) writes; hit overrides only inside an attack active window. Sprite sheets: 320x256 cells, feet-anchored (0.5,1.0), art faces +x. IDs match public/sprites/<id>/ and concepts/characters/2026-07-17/.",
